OHOS: URI authorization, `filesDir` OCR/QR models, and the second
authorization for a recognition result's companion .txt file all have real
platform callers and cannot be collapsed into a plain `QFile` URI write.
Since 1.6.1 upstream itself merged the two screenshot-save paths into a
single `saveSourceToFile` helper, so this patch now only carries the OHOS
part: stage the export locally, then hand the bytes to the authorized
document URI through the user-file export queue, keeping error handling,
thread hand-off, cleanup and history-completion behavior unchanged.

